     "<div dir=\"ltr\">(Moving discussion to shinyapps-users group)<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Wed, Mar 29, 2017 at 2:31 PM Jeff Leek &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jtl...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Everyone<div><br></div><div>Let&#39;s say I have a Shiny app: <a href=\"http://jhubiostatistics.shinyapps.io/myapp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://jhubiostatistics.shinyapps.io/myapp&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361098200000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1g2HWUoGezRAgMLPvxq49N\">jhubiostatistics.shinyapps.io/myapp</a> and I also am the owner of the domain <a href=\"http://myapp.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://myapp.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361098200000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qhIMtgtSVzxUI5jLbPhOy\">myapp.io</a>. Is it possible to set it up so that <a href=\"http://myapp.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://myapp.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361098200000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qhIMtgtSVzxUI5jLbPhOy\">myapp.io</a> maps to  <a href=\"http://jhubiostatistics.shinyapps.io/myapp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://jhubiostatistics.shinyapps.io/myapp&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361098200000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1g2HWUoGezRAgMLPvxq49N\">jhubiostatistics.shinyapps.io/myapp</a>. From these instructions: <a href=\"https://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/custom-domains.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/custom-domains.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361098200000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0_j1rEYKM-SG2BCmpTJcVj\">https://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/custom-domains.html</a> it isn&#39;t clear you can map a custom domain to a single app. Or maybe I&#39;m reading it wrong? I have tried: </div><div><br></div><div>1. Setting up on Namecheap a CNAME for <a href=\"http://myapp.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://myapp.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361098200000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qhIMtgtSVzxUI5jLbPhOy\">myapp.io</a> with the url <a href=\"http://jhubiostatistics.shinyapps.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://jhubiostatistics.shinyapps.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361098200000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3U_csi1w54uew1ym4-lYpm\">jhubiostatistics.shinyapps.io/</a></div><div>2. Adding <a href=\"http://myapp.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://myapp.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361098200000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qhIMtgtSVzxUI5jLbPhOy\">myapp.io</a> to domains on my dashboard</div><div>3. Adding the url <a href=\"http://myapp.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://myapp.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361098200000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qhIMtgtSVzxUI5jLbPhOy\">myapp.io</a> to my app</div><div><br></div><div>But when I navigate to <a href=\"http://myapp.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://myapp.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361098200000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qhIMtgtSVzxUI5jLbPhOy\">myapp.io</a> it can&#39;t find anything. </div><div><br></div><div>Any help would be appreciated! Also happy to provide more info if I&#39;ve missed something. </div><div><br></div><div>Jeff</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe f